# StyLua is configured with line_endings = "Unix" (see stylua.toml), but Git on Windows
# defaults to core.autocrlf=true and hands out CRLF working copies. Without this file a
# fresh Windows clone fails `stylua --check` on every single file, with a diff that shows
# identical text on both sides. Pinning the sources to LF in the working tree avoids it.
*.luau text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
